@page "/markets/telecom"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Telecommunications electronics manufacturing";
    ViewData["Motion"] = "market";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Telecom manufacturing at Hana: RF and millimeter-wave modules, GaN RF power packages, hermetic fiber-optic receivers and wireless modules, in Thailand and China.";
    ViewData["Canonical"] = "https://www.hanagroup.com/markets/telecom";
}
@section Head {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/market-page.css" />
}

<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Telecommunications</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><span class="hero-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1 class="mk-h1">Telecommunications electronics manufacturing</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures RF, microwave and millimeter-wave modules, RF power packages, hermetic optical receivers and wireless communication modules for telecommunications and datacom applications. Capabilities include controlled high-frequency interconnect, shielding, hermetic package sealing and RF and wireless test across multiple Hana sites.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="/images/photos/mk-telecommunications-hero.webp" alt="Network infrastructure assembly" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>RF/microwave modules</span><span>mmWave modules</span><span>RF power amplifiers</span><span>Fiber-optic receivers</span><span>Wireless comms modules</span><span>RF test &amp; measurement PCBA</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark" data-hana-geo="side" data-geo-theme="blue"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">High-frequency assembly, optical packaging and RF test</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">RF, microwave and millimeter-wave assemblies require controlled signal paths, shielding, interconnect and package construction, because these assembly variables form part of the module's electrical performance. Hana's telecom work draws on decades of high-frequency manufacturing experience in module assembly, RF power packaging and hermetic optical packaging.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Signal-integrity discipline</div><p>Grounding, shielding and die-attach quality are controlled during assembly and checked by RF measurement on the completed module.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">RF and wireless test</div><p>Rack-and-stack RF measurement, and LitePoint test for Wi-Fi and cellular modules. Production fixtures can use pogo-pin RF contacts in place of U.FL cables to reduce connector wear.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-site manufacturing</div><p>Telecom manufacturing across Hana sites in Thailand and China provides additional production capacity and supply-continuity options within the group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c3"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/telecom/rf-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-telecommunications-card-rf-assembly.webp" alt="RF module on the high-frequency line" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;"></div><div class="body"><div class="t">RF Modules &amp; Power Amplifiers</div><p>RF, microwave and millimeter-wave modules, GaN RF power packages and seam-sealed frequency doublers, with controlled high-frequency interconnect, shielding and rack-and-stack RF test.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/capabilities/osat/hermetic-ceramic"><div class="mk-ph"><span class="cap">TO-46 optical receiver</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Fiber-Optic Receivers</div><p>TO-46 metal-can and ceramic receivers for datacom and telecom, with APD/TIA die on ceramic submounts, cap welding in a nitrogen chamber and fine and gross leak test.</p><span class="more">Hermetic packaging <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/industrial-iot/iot-device-assembly"><div class="mk-ph"><span class="cap">Wireless module test</span></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Wireless Communication Modules</div><p>Assembly and test of embedded Wi-Fi, cellular and GPS modules and Bluetooth Low Energy SiP, with LitePoint wireless test and fixtures designed for production RF test.</p><span class="more">IoT device assembly <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2><p class="mk-body">Telecom manufacturing runs at three Hana plants in Thailand and China, each covering a different part of the product range. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from telecom engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for telecommunications?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures RF, microwave and millimeter-wave modules, GaN RF power packages, frequency doublers, hermetic fiber-optic receivers, embedded wireless communication modules and PCBA for RF test and measurement equipment.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What RF and high-frequency experience does Hana have?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana has decades of experience manufacturing RF, microwave and high-frequency electronics, including module assembly, RF power amplifiers, shielding, fiber-optic components and rack-and-stack RF measurement.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What optical packages can Hana assemble for datacom and telecom?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana can assemble TO-46 metal-can receivers with window lenses and custom ceramic receiver packages, using APD/TIA die on ceramic submounts. TO-can caps are welded in a nitrogen chamber for a hermetic seal, followed by fine and gross leak test.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve telecom programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Telecom manufacturing runs across Thailand, including Lamphun for millimeter-wave modules and Ayutthaya for microwave components, RF power packages and optical receivers, and China at Jiaxing for embedded wireless communication modules.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana test high-frequency and wireless products?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana can test with rack-and-stack RF instrumentation, including spectrum analyzers, network analyzers and noise-figure measurement. Wireless modules can be tested for Wi-Fi, cellular and GPS performance on LitePoint IQflex and IQxstream systems. The test configuration is selected according to program requirements.</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start a telecom build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us what the product does and the frequencies it runs at. We will point you to the right site and processes, and come back with a plan.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>

